menu "Koios TEE Client (ESP32-S3)"
    depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3

    config KOIOS_TEE_CLIENT_ENABLED
        bool "Enable Koios TEE Client"
        default y
        help
            Enable Koios TEE Client for calling TEE services from the app.
            Requires TEE to be initialized by the bootloader.

    config KOIOS_TEE_EXCLUDE_RTC_FAST
        bool "Exclude RTC FAST from app heap"
        default y
        depends on KOIOS_TEE_CLIENT_ENABLED
        help
            When enabled, RTC FAST memory (0x600FE000-0x60100000) is reserved
            for TEE and not added to the app's heap. This prevents the app
            from overwriting TEE code and shared memory.

endmenu
